  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rice and Tomato Production Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice.Beneficiaries: 177 (66 women).Description: The group will install a pump on the Senegal River and construct an irrigation system to increase access to water and increase the area under production from 70 to 127 ha and improve soil quality by reducing salinization. Average yields are expected to increase from 5 to 6.1 T/ha due to improved water access and reduced salinization and training in improved production techniques..</narrative>
  </description>
